Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.01,0:00:04.86,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.33,0:00:07.83,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.97,0:00:10.28,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦啦啦啦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.98,0:00:13.01,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.47,0:00:15.97,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈 怎麼回事啊？Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.16,0:00:17.91,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你們就只有閃得快嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.06,0:00:23.02,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.19,0:00:24.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.19,0:00:27.81,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,趁它離遠了 大家快跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.47,0:00:30.47,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.00,0:00:35.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.74,0:00:37.06,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.45,0:00:41.62,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,沒受傷吧？好了 快跑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.04,0:00:46.70,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky！Prism！人們都去避難了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.94,0:00:48.06,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.55,0:00:51.70,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.05,0:00:54.48,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1055)}噠！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.05,0:00:54.52,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1372,1055)}噠！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.70,0:00:55.60,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.01,0:00:58.38,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.91,0:00:59.65,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Wing！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.81,0:01:00.75,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,趁現在！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.26,0:01:04.26,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄氣闊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.39,0:01:06.56,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,飛翼衝擊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.39,0:01:06.56,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Wing Attack！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.88,0:01:13.08,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,豁然開朗
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.88,0:01:13.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}豁然開朗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.90,0:01:20.32,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,魔鏡平板！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.90,0:01:20.32,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Mirrorpad！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.37,0:01:28.71,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,OK！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.63,0:01:40.42,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,欸...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.86,0:01:43.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贏了 贏了！不愧是Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.74,0:01:44.60,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.77,0:01:46.33,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,喂！那邊那個看戲的！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.62,0:01:47.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.88,0:01:52.01,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,話要說清楚 我可還沒有認真起來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.11,0:01:56.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死鴨子嘴硬可是很遜的哦？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.28,0:01:57.29,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.55,0:01:59.87,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,就你這個不參加戰鬥的旁觀者...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.02,0:02:02.12,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你們做好準備 下次送你們上路！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.46,0:02:03.32,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.70,0:02:07.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都說了 你這樣子好遜的...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.50,0:02:11.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他說的是沒錯啦 我只是個局外人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.44,0:02:13.07,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,才沒有這回事！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.44,0:02:13.07,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有這回事的！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.16,0:02:16.45,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶是我們重要的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.72,0:02:20.37,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,一直都支援著我們 我們才能努力戰鬥！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.90,0:02:22.91,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,小公主也很喜歡姐姐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.48,0:02:24.66,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,稀飯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.88,0:02:26.48,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.88,0:02:26.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.89,0:02:30.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我也要加把勁！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.66,0:02:31.55,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.46,0:02:36.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是這樣的 我終於要開始去幼兒園實習了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.07,0:02:41.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 現在就已經期待得不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.63,0:02:43.35,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶 加油啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.45,0:02:45.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然的！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.19,0:02:48.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要神采飛揚地上了哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.17,0:04:27.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}振翅飛揚！最強的保育員 Cure Butterfly!!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.17,0:04:27.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}{\fs50\pos(1335,980)}蝴蝶愈衛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.62,0:04:31.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1330,523)}{\fs50}天窗市幼兒園
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.19,0:04:31.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小朋友們 來介紹一下新老師
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.10,0:04:34.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初次見面 我叫聖蝶華！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.42,0:04:39.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然還是個實習老師 不過我的目標可是最強的保育員！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.15,0:04:42.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請多多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.55,0:04:45.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請多多關照！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.95,0:04:49.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她說最強欸！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.25,0:04:50.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好帥啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.88,0:04:53.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最強的是Precure啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.96,0:04:56.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道Precure嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.81,0:04:57.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.92,0:05:01.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們是和邪惡的怪獸戰鬥 非常厲害的英雄！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.20,0:05:03.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.77,0:05:04.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.60,0:05:06.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.63,0:05:07.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很帥的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.68,0:05:12.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在河邊受到過Cure Wing的幫助！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.27,0:05:15.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我也想像Cure Wing那樣變強！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.76,0:05:18.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸！Wing肯定會很開心的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.87,0:05:19.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.82,0:05:20.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.79,0:05:22.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你認識Precure嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.53,0:05:23.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.66,0:05:26.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？小蝶老師是Precure嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.25,0:05:27.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說過是最強的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.05,0:05:29.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.23,0:05:30.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿巴巴巴巴巴巴...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.83,0:05:32.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不是Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.71,0:05:35.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該算是... 同伴吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.42,0:05:37.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.67,0:05:38.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厲害！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.40,0:05:44.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事情就是這樣的 這裡是幼兒園小朋友寫的信！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.71,0:05:45.96,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.12,0:05:46.90,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,康康！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.37,0:05:49.53,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,哇... 啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.70,0:05:54.03,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,咳咳！還是盡量不要議論我們比較好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.68,0:05:56.72,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,要是我們的真身暴露了...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.07,0:05:59.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉抱歉 你先來看看吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.26,0:06:02.68,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,最喜歡Cure Wing了\N\N（我要像你一樣 成為最強的 ——健）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.94,0:06:04.40,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,心頭一緊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.30,0:06:07.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿健好像是Wing的大粉絲呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.80,0:06:09.31,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,心頭一顫！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.19,0:06:13.98,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,回... 回信該什麼時候寫啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.26,0:06:16.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.50,0:06:17.19,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.50,0:06:24.61,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,畢... 畢竟不回信 有違騎士的禮儀
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.23,0:06:26.71,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯吧？公主
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.91,0:06:27.92,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,對噠！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.49,0:06:30.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小白你們也能回信嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.46,0:06:31.48,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,當然的！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.46,0:06:31.48,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an3}當然的！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.61,0:06:32.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.19,0:06:36.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 對了對了 實習期我就住這裡了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.02,0:06:39.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已經跟由由阿姨說過了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.66,0:06:40.66,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.89,0:06:42.57,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶姐也要住在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.74,0:06:43.91,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.78,0:06:48.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我就繼續做實習的準備了 準備起來
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.46,0:06:51.55,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,蝶華很開心的樣子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.15,0:06:53.41,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.66,0:06:57.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘎哦！怪獸來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.93,0:06:58.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.09,0:07:02.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不怕！飛翼愈衛拳！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.94,0:07:03.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.71,0:07:04.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.56,0:07:06.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怪獸怎麼可以不中招！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.21,0:07:08.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰讓老師是最強的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.12,0:07:10.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最強的是Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.09,0:07:12.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊對對對
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.00,0:07:15.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿呦 好了 爽快了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.68,0:07:18.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大口大口地
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.84,0:07:20.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對對 很熟練呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.35,0:07:24.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小朋友們 Precure給你們回信了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.27,0:07:26.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.01,0:07:33.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,努力成為最強吧 Cure Wing致
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.67,0:07:35.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.82,0:07:41.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎喲... 真是太滿足了...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.97,0:07:44.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蝶華老師！阿健他！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.12,0:07:46.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.21,0:07:48.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗚嗚嗚
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.26,0:07:50.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吵架了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.44,0:07:54.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰讓他不遵守次序 我就教訓了他
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.28,0:07:58.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣啊 可是打人不好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.98,0:08:00.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是要成為最強的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.18,0:08:03.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要像Precure那樣 打擊邪惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.95,0:08:07.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿健？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.22,0:08:11.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老師認為啊 成為最強
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.52,0:08:14.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最需要的 並不是打倒別人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.61,0:08:16.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不對！我才是對的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.16,0:08:18.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.37,0:08:20.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶老師才不是最強的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.11,0:08:22.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿健！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.85,0:08:24.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,就是那家幼兒園吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.85,0:08:26.88,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,大家是不是都很開心啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.16,0:08:30.33,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我們就悄悄地看一看 不要打擾到小蝶！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.52,0:08:31.11,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.28,0:08:32.37,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,悄悄地！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.55,0:08:33.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.54,0:08:36.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿健 不要跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.39,0:08:37.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,討厭 討厭！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.71,0:08:41.73,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,阿健？是他 就是那個時候的小朋友...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.08,0:08:46.72,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,他跟小蝶姐在玩抓鬼呢 小時候我常常玩的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.97,0:08:49.94,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不過 怎麼好像很拚命的樣子...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.27,0:08:52.38,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,抓鬼可是要真刀真槍一決勝負的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.74,0:08:57.43,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,呵呵呵... 好了 該開始這場秀了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.75,0:09:00.13,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧！暗塌谷能量！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.48,0:09:11.13,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴獸！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.78,0:09:12.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.34,0:09:14.11,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那是！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.44,0:09:15.74,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴獸！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.03,0:09:26.05,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.12,0:09:27.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗚...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.02,0:09:30.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿健 不要離開我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.68,0:09:32.37,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 那邊看戲的！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.13,0:09:36.52,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你上次說我“死鴨子嘴硬”是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.09,0:09:39.23,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,正好這次觀眾多
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.40,0:09:43.06,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我要當著你和小鬼們的面 把Precure揍個開花
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.24,0:09:45.35,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,讓你們認清楚現實
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.99,0:09:47.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你居然就為了這種事...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.51,0:09:51.17,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你個看戲的 就閉上嘴默默地觀賞吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.36,0:09:52.60,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我們上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
