Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.77,0:10:09.29,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,海闊天空變身！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.33,0:10:12.39,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,飛翼！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.33,0:10:12.39,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Wing！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.74,0:10:22.15,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,閃耀起步！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.74,0:10:22.15,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}HOP
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.73,0:10:30.19,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,爽朗飛奔！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.73,0:10:30.19,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}STEP
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.29,0:10:38.16,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,暢快躍起！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.29,0:10:38.16,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}JUMP
