Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.69,0:11:00.77,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,廣闊無限的藍天！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.10,0:11:03.44,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.10,0:11:03.44,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}天空愈衛！
