Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.87,0:11:10.50,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,遼闊拂遠的柔光！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.35,0:11:12.73,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Prism！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.35,0:11:12.73,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}稜鏡愈衛！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.73,0:11:19.75,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,高闊凌雲的勇氣！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.61,0:11:22.07,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Wing！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.61,0:11:22.07,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}飛翼愈衛！
