Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.96,0:11:37.51,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,來了啊 Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.72,0:11:38.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.69,0:11:39.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Wing！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.36,0:11:42.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.35,0:11:43.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.93,0:11:47.35,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,阿健 謝謝你給我寫信 後面的交給我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.41,0:11:49.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.77,0:11:51.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,大家快去安全的地方！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.23,0:11:53.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是！我們快走吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.27,0:11:55.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿健也快去避難
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.72,0:11:57.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.30,0:12:01.06,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 觀眾都跑了 我這麼幹還有什麼意義
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.26,0:12:02.49,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,別放他們走！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.42,0:12:05.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.66,0:12:07.22,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,快住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.57,0:12:10.90,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.30,0:12:14.67,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,看招！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.01,0:12:17.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.65,0:12:22.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒看到小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.32,0:12:25.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望她有安全躲起來...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.91,0:12:31.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要見證Precure有多強！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.25,0:12:38.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要讓我們認清楚的現實 就這？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.84,0:12:43.35,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼可能！雖然觀眾只剩你一個了 略微可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.60,0:12:45.82,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,好戲才要上演呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.32,0:12:47.95,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.54,0:12:59.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.74,0:13:03.02,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然我原則上是不喜欺負弱者的...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.90,0:13:05.10,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,動手
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.05,0:13:07.08,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.28,0:13:09.52,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.69,0:13:10.54,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.69,0:13:10.54,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.67,0:13:15.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.96,0:13:17.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.15,0:13:20.54,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空... 小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.35,0:13:25.74,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,被困住了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.91,0:13:31.16,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈哈 我就料到了你們這些\N\N自居正義伙伴的傢伙 會這麼做的！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.59,0:13:33.76,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,這下你們就是籠中鳥了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.17,0:13:35.58,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,這種東西！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.44,0:13:40.17,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗚... 啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.34,0:13:41.94,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我使不出稜鏡光流
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.26,0:13:45.80,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,那是由暗塌谷能量濃縮而成的球體
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.98,0:13:50.19,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,在裡面你們無法施展力量 不可能逃出來
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.52,0:13:55.01,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,就是這個！就這個！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.21,0:13:59.71,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是想看你們這副表情啊 Precure！啊啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.91,0:14:03.94,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,如何啊 看戲的 這下你明白我有多強了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.38,0:14:07.63,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,只要再抓住小公主 就是我的完勝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.10,0:14:11.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼可能... 最強的Precure居然輸了...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.94,0:14:14.06,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 對了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.25,0:14:17.17,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,還有另一個觀眾 我很開心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.43,0:14:19.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿健！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.77,0:14:20.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.30,0:14:22.43,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,別放過他！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.88,0:14:25.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.61,0:14:27.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.59,0:14:28.68,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,阿健！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.74,0:14:35.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要放肆！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.40,0:14:41.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不會放任你們繼續肆意妄為！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.51,0:14:42.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老師...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.65,0:14:44.88,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.08,0:14:47.59,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈哈 真是好戲啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.76,0:14:49.97,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你個看戲的 準備怎麼樣我？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.43,0:14:52.17,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你先逃一個給我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.32,0:14:53.77,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.11,0:14:56.86,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.38,0:14:58.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,緊緊抓住我！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.03,0:15:08.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.00,0:15:12.26,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈 不錯 加油啊 看戲的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.43,0:15:13.37,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.56,0:15:19.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.09,0:15:24.59,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.82,0:15:28.35,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.49,0:15:30.51,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,成了...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.88,0:15:35.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈 哈 哈 哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.62,0:15:37.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿健 沒事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.07,0:15:39.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.91,0:15:43.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈 哈... 太好了...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.58,0:15:46.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈 哈 哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.78,0:15:47.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老師...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.76,0:15:48.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒關係...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.35,0:15:53.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.97,0:15:57.67,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,欸... 欸... 作為看戲的 還有兩下子嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.20,0:16:00.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能不能別再說我是“看戲的”？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.47,0:16:06.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure和幼兒園的大家 都是我很珍重的人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.56,0:16:11.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以說... 我才不是看戲的！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.82,0:16:15.28,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嗚... 你不是看戲的 那你算什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.47,0:16:16.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保育員
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.63,0:16:17.83,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.28,0:16:21.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且 最強的保育員 最強的英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.82,0:16:23.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們的目標都是相同的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.24,0:16:27.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是守護親朋好友！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.78,0:16:33.41,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,那又如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.57,0:16:36.55,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你連Precure都不是 無能為力的傢伙又能怎麼樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.99,0:16:41.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這麼說的話... 那我就 我就！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.85,0:16:48.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.11,0:16:49.75,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.92,0:16:51.00,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嗚...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.16,0:16:52.40,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,那種光芒是...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.65,0:16:53.47,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an3}嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.65,0:16:53.47,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.09,0:16:56.04,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,難... 難不成...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.58,0:17:04.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿健 這樣老師也是最強的了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.14,0:17:06.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.51,0:17:10.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶老師已經是最強的了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.60,0:17:12.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.13,0:17:14.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.18,0:17:14.99,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.19,0:17:16.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神采飛揚地上吧！
Dialogue: 1,0:17:15.19,0:17:16.99,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}神采飛揚地上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.14,0:17:19.45,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,飛揚！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.82,0:17:24.58,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.65,0:17:30.89,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,讓你見識一下 最強保育員的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.65,0:17:37.17,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,天空幻鏡！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.65,0:17:37.17,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Sky Mirage！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.22,0:17:41.00,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,天籟接通！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.22,0:17:41.00,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Tone Connect！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.51,0:17:47.21,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,海闊天空變身！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.61,0:17:49.85,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,蝴蝶！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.61,0:17:49.85,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Butterfly！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.23,0:17:59.44,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,閃耀起步！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.23,0:17:59.44,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}HOP
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.97,0:18:07.72,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,爽朗飛奔！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.97,0:18:07.72,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}STEP
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.87,0:18:15.74,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,暢快躍起！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.87,0:18:15.74,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}JUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.42,0:18:38.57,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,壯闊飛揚的神彩！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.42,0:18:38.57,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1095,970)}Wonderful
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.34,0:18:41.21,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Butterfly！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.34,0:18:41.21,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}蝴蝶愈衛！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.49,0:18:46.23,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.57,0:18:47.94,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an3}Butterfly！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.57,0:18:47.94,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Butterfly！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.87,0:18:52.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶老師是...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.23,0:18:55.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.36,0:18:59.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Butterfly 加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.04,0:19:01.28,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,明白！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.56,0:19:04.58,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你也只有入甕的份！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.56,0:19:07.59,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.88,0:19:15.09,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.73,0:19:19.03,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,對神采飛揚的我 是不起作用的！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.38,0:19:20.06,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.24,0:19:21.61,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,精彩！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.24,0:19:21.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Wonderful！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.92,0:19:25.81,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,稍等一下 我馬上就收拾了那傢伙 把你們放出來！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.01,0:19:27.03,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.20,0:19:28.94,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,別... 別得寸進尺！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.02,0:19:32.02,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.61,0:19:35.26,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.00,0:19:41.11,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,遊戲的時間 結束了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.47,0:19:48.32,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,這個我稍微借用一下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.21,0:19:51.76,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,什...什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.96,0:19:55.90,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,乖乖地躺下吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.81,0:19:59.80,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.08,0:20:02.42,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.65,0:20:05.12,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 清爽了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.66,0:20:08.13,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄氣闊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.34,0:20:10.34,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,蝴蝶撲擊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.34,0:20:10.34,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Butterfly Press！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.80,0:20:16.66,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,豁然開朗
Dialogue: 1,0:20:13.80,0:20:16.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}豁然開朗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.90,0:20:24.41,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,魔鏡平板！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.90,0:20:24.41,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Mirrorpad！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.44,0:20:32.78,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,OK！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.51,0:20:35.67,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,別... 別得意忘形！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.08,0:20:38.22,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我只要繼續認真起來...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.38,0:20:39.77,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我隨時都樂意奉陪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.11,0:20:46.25,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,只是... 你要是再對我珍重的人出手
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.11,0:20:48.43,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,沒你好果子吃！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.89,0:20:51.42,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嗚... 虛蜢蜢！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.91,0:20:56.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贏了！Cure Butterfly 太帥了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.41,0:21:00.63,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,老師的事情 要跟大家保密哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.81,0:21:04.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！我也要保護親朋友好 我要成為最強！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.40,0:21:06.76,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.09,0:21:08.88,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Butterfly！以後就能...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.06,0:21:10.86,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,一起戰鬥了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.11,0:21:13.09,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,非常非常地開心！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.26,0:21:14.21,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,飛揚！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.41,0:21:15.50,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.66,0:21:17.57,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,從今天開始 保育員和Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.76,0:21:20.68,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,兩方面都會努力的 請多關照！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.16,0:21:26.43,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,阿健也喜歡上了Butterfly呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.73,0:21:26.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}最喜歡Cure Butterfly了 ——阿健
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.99,0:21:28.63,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,大顯身手了一把呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.95,0:21:29.82,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.00,0:21:34.93,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,真希望小蝶再住過來呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.70,0:21:36.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（門鈴聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.60,0:21:38.75,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是誰呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.98,0:21:42.88,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,久等...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.06,0:21:44.26,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,驚喜！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.43,0:21:46.17,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.55,0:21:47.65,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.81,0:21:50.09,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？那些行李是？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.32,0:21:51.11,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 這個嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.24,0:21:53.29,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.71,0:21:57.38,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我搬過來了 畢竟也已經成為Precure了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.56,0:21:59.32,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,還是住一起比較好吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.68,0:22:01.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,驚喜！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.50,0:22:02.39,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,飛揚！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.66,0:22:04.70,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,Yes 神采飛揚！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.72,0:22:09.20,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Butterfly喲！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.72,0:22:09.20,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1060,970)}蝴蝶愈衛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.04,0:22:12.91,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 一起飛揚跳起來！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.37,0:23:49.16,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶做的飯 真好吃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.36,0:23:50.72,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,掃除也是完美的！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.89,0:23:51.84,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,欸嘿嘿...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.23,0:23:54.10,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,會不會太拚命了啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.29,0:23:56.72,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼少年 能拜託你一件事嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.88,0:23:58.03,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,交給我吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.88,0:24:00.27,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.88,0:24:00.27,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海闊天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.42,0:24:03.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,蝶華和翼 神彩飛揚地向前衝！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.42,0:24:03.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}colorful
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.33,0:02:51.54,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（衝上藍天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.54,0:02:57.13,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 超越雲巔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.34,0:03:02.68,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飛吧！向著海闊天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.68,0:03:10.37,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空萬里 美麗藍天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.58,0:03:15.56,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨後初霽天空稜鏡折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.81,0:03:19.78,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,藍天的景色預告著有好事發生
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.78,0:03:21.28,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（藍天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.28,0:03:25.58,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要確認一下 便伸直了雙手
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.16,0:03:30.16,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名為希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.25,0:03:32.12,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速緊握！緊緊握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.25,0:03:36.71,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,戰勝絕望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.09,0:03:40.65,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我們能堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.65,0:03:44.05,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦乾眼淚
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.70,0:03:44.05,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已經做好準備了嗎）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.05,0:03:46.10,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飛躍而起
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.45,0:03:46.10,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(讓我們張開勇氣之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.43,0:03:51.81,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 朝氣蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.02,0:03:56.48,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把煩躁化為光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.71,0:04:01.78,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未來的圖景 充滿著可能
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.95,0:04:06.53,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,與在同一片藍天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.91,0:04:09.33,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起喚起通向明日的奇蹟！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.45,0:04:17.33,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海闊天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.11,0:22:29.78,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了!! 晴空萬里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.77,0:22:34.35,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是能實現夢想與心願的蔚藍
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.52,0:22:37.11,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,打開心中的麥克風
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.11,0:22:38.94,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,輕輕哼唱起！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.94,0:22:41.32,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,希望的旋律♪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.78,0:22:44.24,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}今天心情愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.24,0:22:46.20,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}如果能與你分享
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.20,0:22:48.87,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,就能打開心靈+門扉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.95,0:22:51.66,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}稍等片刻！我已經激動到勢不可擋!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.66,0:22:53.33,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}笑容也在合唱！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.46,0:22:56.00,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧☆我的好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.14,0:23:02.56,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}還是那條街 {\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}就像平日裡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.27,0:23:08.39,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都在那裡 這便是奇蹟啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.39,0:23:10.73,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的寶貝！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.44,0:23:15.11,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都過來！傳開這韻律
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.11,0:23:19.37,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,手牽起手 心連起心
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.37,0:23:25.45,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,用溫暖的關懷 培育出的勇氣 是無窮無窮的∞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.54,0:23:29.71,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,積極的圖示是標記
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.71,0:23:33.88,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,想要更了解！這海闊天空的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.88,0:23:37.58,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我們展開翅膀 飛向藍天
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.58,0:23:38.97,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,連接起人與人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.97,0:23:41.68,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure 笑容的圓環！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
